{"text": "Design-side, I live in Figma \u2014 plus Photoshop and Illustrator, where I'm genuinely expert after twenty years. Dev-side, I'm a React person, I've shipped iOS in Swift, and I'm comfortable in AWS. I run product in Jira end to end \u2014 sprints, releases, the whole cadence. And the connective tissue is research: interviews, forms, A/B tests, lots of them. I'll be straight about the edges too \u2014 my backend work is mostly fixing things in TypeScript repos with AI as my pair, and I'd call that working knowledge, not mastery. Oh, and the avatar you're talking to? Rive, ElevenLabs, and Claude. I built that too.", "words": [["Design", 0.0], ["side", 0.48], ["I", 1.12], ["live", 1.36], ["in", 1.64], ["Figma", 1.76], ["plus", 2.64], ["Photoshop", 2.8], ["and", 3.32], ["Illustrator", 3.44], ["where", 4.24], ["I'm", 4.4], ["genuinely", 4.64], ["expert", 5.2], ["after", 5.68], ["twenty", 6.0], ["years", 6.4], ["Dev", 7.28], ["side", 7.584], ["I'm", 8.2], ["a", 8.347], ["React", 8.4], ["person", 8.8], ["I've", 9.44], ["shipped", 9.6], ["iOS", 9.84], ["in", 10.28], ["Swift", 10.48], ["and", 11.16], ["I'm", 11.32], ["comfortable", 11.52], ["in", 12.0], ["AWS", 12.12], ["I", 13.36], ["run", 13.52], ["product", 13.68], ["in", 14.12], ["Jira", 14.24], ["end", 14.72], ["to", 14.96], ["end", 15.12], ["sprints", 15.733], ["releases", 16.4], ["the", 17.08], ["whole", 17.28], ["cadence", 17.64], ["And", 18.48], ["the", 18.64], ["connective", 18.72], ["tissue", 19.12], ["is", 19.6], ["research", 19.84], ["interviews", 20.8], ["forms", 21.8], ["A", 22.32], ["B", 22.8], ["tests", 23.2], ["lots", 23.84], ["of", 24.16], ["them", 24.24], ["I'll", 24.96], ["be", 25.08], ["straight", 25.2], ["about", 25.44], ["the", 25.64], ["edges", 25.76], ["too", 26.2], ["my", 26.8], ["backend", 27.08], ["work", 27.36], ["is", 27.6], ["mostly", 27.84], ["fixing", 28.4], ["things", 28.8], ["in", 29.08], ["TypeScript", 29.2], ["repos", 29.76], ["with", 30.24], ["AI", 30.4], ["as", 30.8], ["my",